        "description": "Scenario 11 (manual): Open PGAdmin Query Tool and verify rows in api_querylog for scenario 6 and 7 terms. Suggested SQL:\nSELECT q.id, u.username, q.search_term, q.results_count, q.queried_at\nFROM api_querylog q\nJOIN api_company c ON q.company_id = c.id\nJOIN auth_user u ON c.user_id = u.id\nORDER BY q.queried_at DESC;"
